    "axis": "memorability",
    "evidence": "The split headline—“The signature is valid. The intent was stolen.”—is sharp and memorable, and the cyan-to-red evidence trail gives the thesis a distinctive forensic narrative on desktop and tablet. However, mobile removes the connecting paths and reduces the idea to a conventional stack of dark cards; the header also becomes a generic icon-plus-scroll rail. The signature visual metaphor is therefore not consistently demo-defining across viewports.",
